Subject: [PATCH] feat(approval): a sign-in grant card keeps the extra hosts a
 sign-in posts to

sanitize_login_grant also keeps post_hosts: a list of at most 4 strings of at most 253 characters (other items dropped), so a device plugin can name the hosts a sign-in posts credentials to and the card and PendingControls prompt carry them. A grant without post_hosts is unchanged. Tests also cover that a plugin tool handler (sync, async, or on a thread carrying the context) can call request_tool_approval(..., login_grant=...) mid-call: the card is raised and the call blocks until answered, once and device approve, deny refuses, and with no human it is blocked.
